    "en": {
      "trackName": "Tennis Score for Watch",
      "description": "The ultimate companion for every tennis match.\n\nForget arguments over the score or confusion during crucial match moments. Tennis Score transforms your Apple Watch into a precise, intuitive, and professional digital scorekeeper. Designed specifically for the watch display, it offers a seamless experience without distracting you from the game.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- Intuitive Scorekeeper: Interface with large buttons to add points (15-30-40) with a simple tap, even while sweating or in motion.\n- Full Match Management: Supports 1, 3, or 5-set matches, with automatic handling of Deuce/Advantage, Tie-breaks, and Super Tie-breaks.\n- \"Undo\" Button: Made a mistake assigning a point? Correct the error instantly.\n- Live Stats: Check points at a glance, directly from your wrist.\n\nWHY CHOOSE US? \nWhether you are a beginner, a club player, or a professional, Tennis Score allows you to focus solely on the ball. Let your Apple Watch keep the score.\n\nDownload now and take your tennis to the next level!",
      "releaseNotes": "- Add HealthKit integration\n- Add new modern UI\n- Add Toss Coin feature",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/tennis-score-for-watch/id6757437297?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$2.99",
